companies to stitch customer identity, stream directly to their own BigQuery, bypass Safari ITP, and ensure GDPR compliance via Crypto-Shredding.\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>⚡</text></svg>\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Enterprise B2B Customer Data Platform | Secure Real-time CDP\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Antigravity B2B CDP enables enterprise SaaS companies to stitch customer identity, stream directly to their own BigQuery, bypass Safari ITP, and ensure GDPR compliance via Crypto-Shredding.\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://acme-cdp.com/og-banner.png\">\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://acme-cdp.com\">\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Antigravity B2B CDP\",\"applicationCategory\":\"BusinessApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"All\",\"softwareVersion\":\"1.0.0\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"}}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does the BYO-BQ model secure my data?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our BYO-BQ model streams event tracking logs directly into your own enterprise Google Cloud BigQuery project. You retain 100% data ownership, full audit control, and pay GCP storage costs directly.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How does B2B CDP overcome third-party cookie restrictions?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Our SDK routes event payloads through your own first-party subdomain (e.g. cdp.yourdomain.com), utilizing CNAME record mapping. This sets secure, Lax, HttpOnly first-party cookies that fully bypass Safari's ITP limitations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is GDPR Crypto-Shredding and how does it support user deletion?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Crypto-Shredding keeps original hashed contact details locally stored in private PostgreSQL maps, substituting them with synthetic_user_ids before outbound routing. A GDPR delete API call purges the mapping row, rendering all downstream data instantly anonymous.\"}}]}</script></head><body><div id=\"__nuxt\"><div><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0a0d1a] text-slate-100 font-sans antialiased bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_10%_20%,hsla(250,90%,60%,0.08)_0%,transparent_40%),radial-gradient(circle_at_90%_80%,hsla(190,90%,50%,0.08)_0%,transparent_45%)] overflow-x-hidden\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><header class=\"border-b border-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-0 z-50 bg-[#0a0d1a]/85\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-20 flex items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"text-3xl bg-indigo-500/15 w-12 h-12 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center border border-indigo-500/25 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/10\">⚡</span><div><span class=\"text-xl font-bold font-title tracking-tight text-white block\">Antigravity CDP</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider block\">Enterprise B2B SaaS Control</span></div></div><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\"><a href=\"#features\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition\">Architecture</a><a href=\"#compliance\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition\">Compliance</a><a href=\"#faq\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition\">FAQ</a></nav><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"relative\"><button id=\"lang-trigger\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-white/5 border border-slate-700/60 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-slate-500 transition text-slate-300 text-sm font-medium select-none\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"listbox\"><span class=\"text-base leading-none\">🇬🇧</span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-wide\">EN</span><span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 inline-block transition-transform duration-200\" style=\"\">▾</span></button><!----></div><button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 bg-white/5 border border-slate-700/60 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-slate-500 rounded-lg transition duration-200\">Book a Demo</button><button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 hover:brightness-110 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20 rounded-lg transition duration-200\">Start Free Trial</button></div></div></header><section class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pt-20 pb-24 text-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-950/40 border border-cyan-800/40 rounded-full mb-6 uppercase tracking-wider\"> 🚀 Next-Generation Identity Stitching</span><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold font-title tracking-tight text-white leading-tight mb-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\">Secure B2B SaaS  <span class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-indigo-400 to-purple-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent\">Customer Data Platform</span></h1><p class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-400 font-body max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 leading-relaxed\">Stitch visitor identity, retain 100% data ownership, bypass Safari cookie limits, and stream real-time events directly into your own enterprise data warehouse.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 to-purple-600 hover:brightness-110 hover:-translate-y-0.5 shadow-xl shadow-indigo-500/20 rounded-xl transition duration-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Start Free Trial <span class=\"text-lg\">→</span></button><button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-slate-300 bg-white/5 border border-slate-700/60 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-slate-500 rounded-xl transition duration-200 flex items-center justify-center\">Book an Enterprise Demo</button></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-900\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-title text-white mb-4\">Architected for Full Ownership &amp; Privacy Compliance</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 font-body max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm md:text-base\">Our platform is designed from the ground up to eliminate SaaS data silos, protect customer identity, and guarantee GDPR compliance.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-800/80 hover:border-indigo-500/40 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-indigo-500/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 mb-6\">☁️</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white font-title mb-4\">Bring Your Own BigQuery (BYO-BQ)</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed mb-4\">Retain absolute control over your customer intelligence. Our SDK streams high-fidelity enriched event logs straight into your enterprise Google Cloud BigQuery dataset.</p><ul class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-2 font-medium\"><li>✔️ Zero intermediary third-party databases</li><li>✔️ Direct Google Cloud SDK integration</li><li>✔️ Low latency stream inserts (insert_rows_json)</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-800/80 hover:border-cyan-500/40 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 mb-6\">🛡️</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white font-title mb-4\">Safari CNAME ITP Bypass</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed mb-4\">Bypass Safari Intelligent Tracking Prevention (ITP) and browser third-party cookie restrictions by routing tracking API calls through your first-party subdomain mapping.</p><ul class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-2 font-medium\"><li>✔️ HTTP-Only secure first-party cookie writing</li><li>✔️ CNAME-based DNS level domain mapping</li><li>✔️ 400-day durable visitor attribution</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-800/80 hover:border-purple-500/40 p-8 rounded-2xl hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/5 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 mb-6\">🔑</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white font-title mb-4\">GDPR Crypto-Shredding</h3><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm font-body leading-relaxed mb-4\">Process and hash PII details (emails/phones) dynamically using client-specific public salts. Substitute them with secure, synthetic IDs before pipeline routing.</p><ul class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 space-y-2 font-medium\"><li>✔️ Decrypted credentials processed in-memory</li><li>✔️ AES-256-GCM symmetric decryption on-the-fly</li><li>✔️ Instant Right-to-be-Forgotten DB deletes</li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 border-t border-slate-900\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold font-title text-white mb-4\">Enterprise Security &amp; Privacy FAQ</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 font-body text-sm\">Everything you need to know about our data residency, cookie handling, and GDPR compliance policies.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><!--[--><div class=\"bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between text-left font-semibold text-white font-title hover:bg-white/5 transition\"><span>How does the BYO-BQ model secure my data?</span><span class=\"text-xl text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0 ms-4\">−</span></button><div class=\"px-6 pb-6 text-slate-400 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed border-t border-slate-800/40 pt-4 bg-slate-950/20\">Our BYO-BQ model streams event tracking logs directly into your own enterprise Google Cloud BigQuery project. You retain 100% data ownership, full audit control, and pay GCP storage costs directly.</div></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between text-left font-semibold text-white font-title hover:bg-white/5 transition\"><span>How does B2B CDP overcome third-party cookie restrictions?</span><span class=\"text-xl text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0 ms-4\">+</span></button><!----></div><div class=\"bg-slate-900/30 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><button class=\"w-full px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between text-left font-semibold text-white font-title hover:bg-white/5 transition\"><span>What is GDPR Crypto-Shredding and how does it support user deletion?</span><span class=\"text-xl text-slate-500 flex-shrink-0 ms-4\">+</span></button><!----></div><!--]--></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-slate-900 bg-slate-950/30\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold font-title text-white mb-4\">Ready to Reclaim Data Ownership?</h2><p class=\"text-slate-400 font-body max-w-lg mx-auto mb-8 text-sm md:text-base\">Start capturing high-fidelity customer event logs and stream them straight into your Cloud Project in under 10 minutes.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center ju